{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118454","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118454/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118454/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118454/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118454","id":4246516635,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79HLOb","number":118454,"title":"CharacterBody real_velocity division by zero on first frame from _process()","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T04:27:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:10Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn both `CharacterBody2D` and `CharacterBody3D`, `move_and_slide()` computes `real_velocity` by dividing by delta:\n\n**character_body_2d.cpp:104:**\n```cpp\nreal_velocity = get_position_delta() / delta;\n```\n\n**character_body_3d.cpp:125:**\n```cpp\nreal_velocity = get_position_delta() / delta;\n```\n\nWhen `move_and_slide()` is called from `_process()` (not `_physics_process()`), `delta` comes from `get_process_delta_time()`. On the very first frame, or in edge cases (application startup), this can return 0.0, causing division by zero and NaN/infinity propagation through the physics system.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Call `move_and_slide()` from `_process()` instead of `_physics_process()`.\n2. On the first frame, `delta` may be 0, producing NaN velocity.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — division by zero visible from source analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118454/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118454/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}